{% extends '@layout/default.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}PHP 5.3.6 released. No upgrade possible for WampServer.{% endblock %}

{% block page_title %}
    <div class="mb-2 text-uppercase small fw-bold text-primary tracking-wider">PHP Development</div>
    <h1 class="fw-bold text-dark display-6 mb-0">PHP 5.3.6 released. No upgrade possible for WampServer.</h1>
    <hr class="mt-4 mb-2 opacity-25">
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
PHP 5.3.6 was released, but it come with a bad news for WampServer users:
<blockquote>"Windows users: please mind that we do no longer provide builds created with Visual Studio C++ 6"</blockquote>
Since WampServer is built using VC++ 6,  is not possible an upgrade , without a rewrite from scratch of entire WampServer package.

More details on WampServer forum  <strong><a href="http://www.wampserver.com/phorum/read.php?2,72243" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">here </a></strong>
{% endblock %}